<title>UK: Consumers more confident, UK Treasury minister says.</title>
<headline>Consumers more confident, UK Treasury minister says.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consumer credit data published today show consumers &quot;are increasingly confident on their own prospects and the outlook for the economy as a whole,&quot; William Waldegrave, chief secretary to the UK Treasury said in a statement.</p>
</text>
